        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository cb7b9923-0098-4336-8bff-6ca0d5d46440).Image",
        "Description": "Your mission in Germany may have thrown a wrench into the Collective&apos;s business endeavors in Berlin, but the escort business is not their only enterprise. The Epstein Collective has a well-diversified portfolio. Edrenochrome harvesting is perhaps their most lucrative undertaking. It is estimated that last year alone Bill Epstein&apos;s Adrenochrome sales took in more that $912,000,000 in gross revenue. \r\rFortunately for us, we know of three Collective members who have surfaced in China.  Kill them.",
